Key Takeaways
Security Best Practices: You've implemented the principle of least privilege by giving users only the minimum access necessary for their roles. This approach significantly reduces security risks in enterprise environments.

Scalable Access Management: The group-based approach you've configured allows for easy management of access rights as organizations grow. Adding new users to appropriate groups automatically grants them the correct access levels.

Compliance and Auditing: The HBAC rules you've created provide clear audit trails and help organizations meet compliance requirements by demonstrating controlled access to sensitive systems.

